# Hydration + Image console (must)

## Hydration

| Pattern | Do |
|---------|-----|
| `useReducedMotion()` | Treat `null` as unknown; do not branch SSR UI on it |
| Typing / caret / random | Gate with `mounted` set in `useEffect` only |
| Body attrs from extensions | `suppressHydrationWarning` on `<html>` + `<body>` |
| Swiper fade + CTAs | Swiper `pointer-events-none`; CTA row `z-30` |
| Portal menus | Render after `mounted` (Header pattern) |

**Never** init state from `reduceMotion ? A : B` if that changes first client paint vs SSR.

## next/image warnings

1. List every `quality={N}` in the repo → add all to `images.qualities` in `next.config.ts`
2. Logo resized by CSS height only → `style={{ width: "auto" }}` (+ `h-* w-auto` classes)
3. Prefer webp from packs; set correct `sizes`

## Favicon tab box

Cream/black square behind mark in the browser tab = bad favicon. Rebuild with **transparent** canvas (`favicon-brand.mdc`). Hard-refresh / clear tab cache after replace.
